{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29065","headline":"和友人送僧归桂州灵岩寺 · 许浑","name":"和友人送僧归桂州灵岩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚客送僧归桂阳，海门帆势极潇湘。\n碧云千里暮愁合，白雪一声春思长。\n柳絮拥堤添衲软，松花浮水注瓶香。\n南京长老几年别，闻道半岩多影堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}